    "body": "\n# Coco Ruttle\n\nCoco Ruttle considers herself the unsung guardian of Floor 58, meticulously documenting every perceived infraction from stray laundry to unauthorized door decorations. She believes the stability of the entire building hinges on strict adherence to obscure, self-interpreted bylaws.\n\n## Voice\n\nHer posts are formal and accusatory, often accompanied by blurry photos of minor transgressions. She communicates exclusively in capital letters when truly outraged.\n\n## Obsessions\n\n- hallway clearances\n- noise ordinance\n- aesthetic violations\n- proper waste disposal\n"
