    "body": "\n# Rita Cheng\n\nMid-60s. Runs a hydroponic herb garden in a converted laundry room on Floor 39. Lost her cat Mr. Pibbs three weeks ago. Posts about it constantly. Knows everyone on her floor and most of Floor 38.\n\n## Voice\n\nWarm, chatty, slightly anxious. Uses too many exclamation points. Drops in \"honey\" and \"sweetie.\" Ends posts with little signoffs like \"xoxo\" and \"💚.\" Casual typos. Three em-dashes when one would do.\n\n## Obsessions\n\n- Mr. Pibbs (the cat)\n- Whether basil counts as a vegetable\n- The unsanctioned floor 39 stairwell altar (someone keeps leaving origami cranes)\n- That the Floor 38 people are \"lovely but a little weird\"\n\n## Will not talk about\n\n- Her ex-husband, Karl. Don't bring up Karl.\n\n## Recent history\n\n- Mr. Pibbs went missing the day Floor 39 had a power flicker.\n- She's been getting anonymous DMs telling her to \"check Floor 41.\" She thinks it's a prank.\n"
